Multi-Ferro-DAQ — License Overview

Copyright (c) 2024–2026 Measurement and Sensor Technology Group (MUST), TU Darmstadt and contributors

This repository contains several types of material. Each type has its own license.
The full license texts are in the LICENSES/ folder.

1. Hardware: CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 – Weakly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-W-2.0)
   Applies to: PCB/ (KiCad schematics, layout, footprints and symbols created for this
   project, Gerber/drill/BOM/CPL production files) and any mechanical design files.
   Full text: LICENSES/CERN-OHL-W-2.0.txt
   Source location: https://github.com/TUDA-MUST/Multi-Ferro-DAQ

2. Software: MIT License (MIT)
   Applies to: Software/ (ESP32 firmware, MultiMeasurementMonitor client, MATLAB scripts),
   except the third-party files listed below.
   Full text: LICENSES/MIT.txt

3. Documentation: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)
   Applies to: README files, BOM documentation, doc/ (images, screenshots) and other
   documentation.
   Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt

